# macOS dmg resources (BL-CATFISH-MAC-OFFLINE-INSTALL 7/15).
#
# 4 个真实 artifact 由 build-macos-resources.sh 在 build 前打包生成,
# 总大小 ~250MB, 不进 git (跟 Windows resources/win/*.zip 同策略).
#
# macOS build 流程 (dev 机 or CircleCI):
#   1. bash src-tauri/scripts/build-macos-resources.sh
#      → 生成 4 个 artifact 到 resources/mac/
#   2. npm run tauri:build
#      → 出 dmg (~130MB, hermes bundle baked)
#
# hermes_install.rs 有 sanity check (size < 1024 报错), fresh clone 若忘
# 跑 build-macos-resources.sh, dmg build 阶段 tauri 会报 resource 缺.

# 4 大 artifact (build 生成, 每次 fresh)
install.sh
uv
cpython-*.tar.gz
hermes-agent-bundle.tar.gz

# build 副产 log
*.log

# BL-MAC-INSTALL-NODE+CHROMIUM-BUNDLE (7/17): build-mac-resources.sh
# 新加 · node-embed + chromium-embed · 也不入库.
chromium-embed.tar.gz
node-embed.tar.gz
